<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>SIPAE — Cambiar Contraseña</title>
    <style>
        *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #fdf5f4;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        .card {
            background: #fff;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 400px;
            padding: 2.25rem 2rem;
            margin: 1rem;
        }
        .card__titulo { font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: .5rem; color: #1e2a3a; text-align: center; }
        .card__sub { font-size: .85rem; color: #6b7280; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; text-align: center; }
        .form-group { margin-bottom: 1.15rem; }
        .form-label { display: block; font-size: .85rem; font-weight: 600; color: #374151; margin-bottom: .35rem; }
        .form-input {
            width: 100%;
            padding: .65rem .85rem;
            border: 1.5px solid #d1d5db;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: .95rem;
            outline: none;
        }
        .form-input:focus { border-color: #ee7374; }
        .btn-submit {
            width: 100%;
            padding: .75rem;
            background: #ee7374;
            color: #fff;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            margin-top: .75rem;
        }
        .btn-submit:hover { background: #ca6263; }
        .alerta-error {
            background: #fee2e2;
            color: #991b1b;
            padding: .75rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: .85rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="card">
    <h1 class="card__titulo">Actualizar Contraseña</h1>
    <p class="card__sub">Por seguridad, debes definir una contraseña personalizada de al menos 8 caracteres.</p>

    <% if (error) { %>
        <div class="alerta-error"><%= error %></div>
    <% } %>

    <form method="post" action="/cambiar_password">
        <div class="form-group">
            <label class="form-label" for="nueva_contrasena">Nueva contraseña</label>
            <input class="form-input" type="password" id="nueva_contrasena" name="nueva_contrasena" required minlength="8" placeholder="Mínimo 8 caracteres">
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
            <label class="form-label" for="confirmar_contrasena">Confirmar contraseña</label>
            <input class="form-input" type="password" id="confirmar_contrasena" name="confirmar_contrasena" required minlength="8" placeholder="Repite la contraseña">
        </div>

        <button class="btn-submit" type="submit">Guardar y Continuar</button>
    </form>
</div>

</body>
</html>
